---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Summary from '../components/Summary.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Provo Therapy Office: Book Sessions | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Visit our Provo therapy office at 63 N 300 E. A welcoming space to start your healing journey with expert therapists. Now accepting new clients."}>
<section class="sec t-white h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:22">
  <div class="b b-map jc" style="--d:4/14/14/24;--m:10/2/22/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div class="map"><iframe title="Map of 201 E Center St. , Provo, UT, 84606" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=201%20E%20Center%20St.%20%2C%20Provo%2C%20UT%2C%2084606&z=15&output=embed" loading="lazy"></iframe></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:6/2/10/10;--m:2/2/5/8"><div class="rte"><h2>Come join us at Tangible in Provo!</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:11/3/13/8;--m:5/2/7/6;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="tel:4352605406">Call Us</a></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:14/15/16/23;--m:7/2/10/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h4 class="ta-center">201 E Center St. Provo, UT 84606<br/>Located on second floor above Altabank</h4></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-light h-custom has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(0vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(0vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:7;--mrows:13">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/8/6/20;--m:2/2/8/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Meet the Provo Tangible Therapy Team</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-summary-v2" style="--d:7/5/8/23;--m:8/2/13/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><Summary kind="team" design="autogrid" category="provo-office" perRow={3} /></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="jagged" height={6} width={100} fill="#acb9ac" flipX flipY /></section>

<section class="sec t-black h-custom">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top: calc(10vmax / 10); padding-bottom: calc(10vmax / 10);">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:55;--mrows:90">
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:3/2/6/26;--m:2/2/5/10"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Here’s what to expect</h1></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:7/15/21/23;--m:8/2/22/10"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-sign-c70fce.jpg" alt="Tangible Therapy waiting room with a potted plant on a oak table with waiting room chairs in the background. All Below a sign on the wall that reads &quot;Tangible Therapy Start Feeling Better&quot;" width="2411" height="3215" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:9/2/11/13;--m:6/2/8/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Come Inside!</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:11/2/18/13;--m:22/2/33/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Welcome to our waiting room. We invite you to step inside and immerse yourself in the serene environment while you wait for your appointment. Thoughtfully designed to promote relaxation and mindfulness. Please note, that there is no receptionist on-site, but should you have any questions, our off-site receptionist is just a phone call away. During your visit, we encourage you to indulge in a comforting drink from our fridge. Enjoy the tranquility, and your therapist will come get you when they’re ready.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:21/2/38/13;--m:35/2/48/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px;--fp:36% 47%"><img src="/images/a-cozy-minimalist-therapy-office-2ca49d.jpg" alt="A cozy, minimalist Therapy office at Tangible Therapy in Provo Utah features a white couch with cushions, a round wooden coffee table, and a shelf with books, plants, and decorative items." width="5054" height="3246" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:25/15/27/26;--m:33/2/35/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div class="rte"><h3>Make yourself comfortable</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:27/15/34/26;--m:48/2/62/10;--dz:6;--mz:6"><div class="rte"><p>In your first therapy session, you'll find yourself in a soothing and inviting space. Please make yourself comfortable on the couch and feel free to wrap up in a blanket or play with the available fidget toys. Your therapist will guide the session so don’t worry about knowing what to say. There are no wrong answers in therapy. This first meeting is more about getting to know each other and setting a foundation for future sessions. You'll have the opportunity to share your thoughts and concerns in a safe, non-judgmental space.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:37/14/55/25;--m:64/2/78/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/a-woven-basket-filled-with-colorful-01d504.jpg" alt="A woven basket filled with colorful snack packets sits on a wooden dresser beside a ceramic lamp. A lush potted plant is visible in the background." width="1536" height="2048" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html jc" style="--d:44/3/46/14;--m:62/2/64/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><h3>We’ve got snacks</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:46/3/55/13;--m:78/2/91/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><p>We understand that discussing challenging topics can sometimes feel daunting. That's why we've created a space where comfort and support are at the forefront of your experience. In addition to our waiting room tea bar, each therapy office is equipped with a selection of snacks, thoughtfully provided for your enjoyment. We recognize that the idea of sitting and talking makes some of our clients anxious, so our therapists offer a variety of fidget toys and mindful games designed to make your sessions more comfortable and engaging. Remember, your therapist is here to support you in every way. </p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
